# KNOWLEDGE_INDEX.md — Context Navigation Map

Use this file as a compact index to durable project knowledge. Keep it current only when the project uses persistent agent state; do not invent links to ADRs, features, or templates that do not exist.

## Project entry points

| Item | Path or reference | Status |
|---|---|---|
| Project profile | `.agent/PROJECT_PROFILE.md` | Required after initialization |
| Current state | `.agent/CURRENT_STATE.md` | Update at meaningful checkpoints |
| Health and lessons | `.agent/AGENTS_MEMORY.md` | Add reusable lessons only |
| Session handoffs | `.agent/SESSION_LOG.md` | Link archives when compacted |
| Native skills | `.agents/skills/` | Installed by the framework initializer |
| Governance | `.agent/core/AGENTS.md` | Read when relevant to the task |

